   "label": "1–10 10小题",
   "stem": "Little Mary’s grandparents have a farm.On the farm there are many kinds of <u>　1　</u>,like dogs and cats.She likes to play with them because they can make her <u>　2　</u>.On the farm there <u>　3　</u> also a little elephant.It has no mother.It always walks around by itself.And Mary is really sorry for the death(死亡) of its <u>　4　</u>.Mary always gives some <u>　5　</u> to it.Bananas are its favourite.Sometimes Mary walks into a wood(树林) <u>　6　</u> the little elephant.There Mary sits on the ground(地面) and <u>　7　</u> a book;the little elephant stands by Mary.Her grandfather always asks her,“<u>　8　</u> does the elephant like you so much?” “Oh,because I love it,Grandpa,” Mary answers.Grandpa thinks Mary is <u>　9　</u>.Animals are our <u>　10　</u>.We should love them. \n(　)1.A.houses\tB.trees\nC.animals\tD.colours\n(　)2.A.sad\tB.happy\nC.sorry\tD.tidy\n(　)3.A.is\tB.am\nC.are\tD.be\n(　)4.A.friend\tB.mother\nC.teacher\tD.brother\n(　)5.A.time\tB.names\nC.food\tD.boxes\n(　)6.A.under\tB.for\nC.of\tD.with\n(　)7.A.reads\tB.buys\nC.sees\tD.draws\n(　)8.A.What\tB.How\nC.Why\tD.When\n(　)9.A.quiet\tB.right\nC.shy\tD.old\n(　)10.A.students\tB.children\nC.parents\tD.friends",
