   "label": "1–4 4小题",
   "stem": "Wu Zeyin,14,comes from Hubei,China.He finds that many fruits and vegetables(蔬菜) in Botswana are very small.And some of them are not good.The carrots are small and the tomatoes are green.But the price(价格) is very <u>high</u>.And he learns that Botswana has to buy many fruits and vegetables from other places.Wu wants to do something to help.\nHe made an app(应用程序) for agriculture(农业)—Farm Assistant.With the help of the app,farmers can know the vegetables’ planting time,watering needs and ripening(成熟) time.\nWu says,“<u>It is better to teach a man to fish than to give him fish.</u>” \n(　)1.What does the underlined word “high” mean?\nA.实惠的\tB.稳定的\nC.高的\tD.低的\n(　)2.[**新考法**·**细节多选**]What can farmers know about the vegetables by using the app?\n①The watering needs.②The selling price.③The planting time.④The ripening time.\nA.①②③\tB.①②④\nC.①③④\tD.②③④\n(　)3.[**新考法**·**跨学科设问**]What do Wu’s words mean?\nA.鱼和熊掌不可兼得。\nB.授人以鱼,不如授人以渔。\nC.三天打鱼,两天晒网。\nD.临渊羡鱼,不如退而结网。\n☆拓展设问\n4.What does Wu find about the fruits and vegetables in Botswana?(不超过15个词)\n<u> </u>",
